{
    "title": "YOYO Decor: Doll Dress Up",
    "description": "\"YOYO Decor\" Doll Dress Up Game is addictive girls makeup Game! Play the dream house & Decoration Game and improve your aesthetic anytime, anywhere, and experience a warm decor life!\r\n\r\nClick, drag and drop cute furniture and decorations to fit in every corner of the house, and decor with beautiful clothes and hairstyles to girls in the makeover game, just like you would in a classic Dress Up and decor home Game. This style game is very simple to play but very addictive. Improve your aesthetic skills with this Fashion Design Game. Of course, you will feel extremely relaxed while enjoying this House decoration game, effectively relieving and releasing your stress!\r\n\r\nIf you like playing Dress Up Games and Home Design Games, you will love this simulation Casual Game. It's easy to play, full of fun and challenge! This YOYO Decor: anime princess game combines the gameplay of Decoration Games and Dress Up Games to bring you a different Fashion Simulation Game that can both entertain and relieve stress.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe1\ud83c\udfe1 Create Picture - Perfect Interior Living Spaces\r\nUse your creative vision to design and construct breathtaking cute furniture rooms for wonderful clients seeking your style. Craft incredible houses or gardens with chic furniture and decor for superior fashion. Choose fashion accents like rugs, wall art and bed to make every space utilized. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf80\ud83c\udf80 Fabulous, On-Trend Home Decor\r\nMake each room amazing with lively, vibrant decorations showing your flair and taste. Pick fun area rugs, beautiful art, cozy seating and sweet pets to give your dream house charm and personality! Endless customization options for your stylish dream house.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f Unlimited Interior Furnishings\r\nDiscover and collect fabulous sofas, tables, chairs and more for mixing and matching stunning colors and patterns. Thoughtfully arrange pieces to construct fully customized, designer dream house. Express your unique style with an extensive catalog of chic furniture.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7\ud83c\udf1f Dress-up and other gameplay features\r\nNot only can you create houses or gardens, but you can also dress up yourself with a variety of styles of clothes, and other mini-games to add more fun in this dream house decoration game. Complete daily tasks like playing with adorable pets, capturing special moments with your spouse or friendly neighbors.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc90\ud83d\udc90 Home Decor Life Game - design to your heart's content\r\nAdorn your home with lovely curtains, plants and accents. Create a welcoming oasis showcasing your personal style and vision. Make your most glamorous decor dreams into reality! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d Fun Features The Whole Family Will Love\r\n- Exciting gameplay - design incredible spaces for interesting clients in a delightful story! \r\n- Creativity galore - tons of on-trend decor choices for custom, fashionable rooms!\r\n- Spark imagination - create your beautiful garden however you envision it!\r\n- Happy decor life world - enjoy positive energy and bonding with friends! \r\n- Accomplishment - manage your business and progress through fabulous chapters in decor life!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f Start Your Interior Design Journey Now!Download Decor life: Home Design Game and unlock possibilities for chic, stylish home design! Begin decorating your dream house immediately and live the lifestyle you've imagined! Customize every corner of your interior home with decor options tailored to your unique taste and style - the possibilities are endless with YOYO Decor life!\r\n\r\n\u3010Contact Us\u3011\r\n\u2013 Discord: https://discord.gg/tSVJcaT6jU\r\n\u2013 FB Page: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61553417999413\r\n\u2013 Email: yoyocreations@outlook.com\r\n\u2013 TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@iamyoyodoll\r\n\u2013 Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSAAS6shg37jLQGd4GhqvAA",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;YOYO Decor&quot; Doll Dress Up Game is addictive girls makeup Game! Play the dream house &amp; Decoration Game and improve your aesthetic anytime, anywhere, and experience a warm decor life!<br><br>Click, drag and drop cute furniture and decorations to fit in every corner of the house, and decor with beautiful clothes and hairstyles to girls in the makeover game, just like you would in a classic Dress Up and decor home Game. This style game is very simple to play but very addictive. Improve your aesthetic skills with this Fashion Design Game. Of course, you will feel extremely relaxed while enjoying this House decoration game, effectively relieving and releasing your stress!<br><br>If you like playing Dress Up Games and Home Design Games, you will love this simulation Casual Game. It&#39;s easy to play, full of fun and challenge! This YOYO Decor: anime princess game combines the gameplay of Decoration Games and Dress Up Games to bring you a different Fashion Simulation Game that can both entertain and relieve stress.<br><br>\ud83c\udfe1\ud83c\udfe1 Create Picture - Perfect Interior Living Spaces<br>Use your creative vision to design and construct breathtaking cute furniture rooms for wonderful clients seeking your style. Craft incredible houses or gardens with chic furniture and decor for superior fashion. Choose fashion accents like rugs, wall art and bed to make every space utilized. <br><br>\ud83c\udf80\ud83c\udf80 Fabulous, On-Trend Home Decor<br>Make each room amazing with lively, vibrant decorations showing your flair and taste. Pick fun area rugs, beautiful art, cozy seating and sweet pets to give your dream house charm and personality! Endless customization options for your stylish dream house.<br><br>\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f Unlimited Interior Furnishings<br>Discover and collect fabulous sofas, tables, chairs and more for mixing and matching stunning colors and patterns. Thoughtfully arrange pieces to construct fully customized, designer dream house. Express your unique style with an extensive catalog of chic furniture.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf7\ud83c\udf1f Dress-up and other gameplay features<br>Not only can you create houses or gardens, but you can also dress up yourself with a variety of styles of clothes, and other mini-games to add more fun in this dream house decoration game. Complete daily tasks like playing with adorable pets, capturing special moments with your spouse or friendly neighbors.<br><br>\ud83d\udc90\ud83d\udc90 Home Decor Life Game - design to your heart&#39;s content<br>Adorn your home with lovely curtains, plants and accents. Create a welcoming oasis showcasing your personal style and vision. Make your most glamorous decor dreams into reality! <br><br>\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d Fun Features The Whole Family Will Love<br>- Exciting gameplay - design incredible spaces for interesting clients in a delightful story! <br>- Creativity galore - tons of on-trend decor choices for custom, fashionable rooms!<br>- Spark imagination - create your beautiful garden however you envision it!<br>- Happy decor life world - enjoy positive energy and bonding with friends! <br>- Accomplishment - manage your business and progress through fabulous chapters in decor life!<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f Start Your Interior Design Journey Now!Download Decor life: Home Design Game and unlock possibilities for chic, stylish home design! Begin decorating your dream house immediately and live the lifestyle you&#39;ve imagined! Customize every corner of your interior home with decor options tailored to your unique taste and style - the possibilities are endless with YOYO Decor life!<br><br>\u3010Contact Us\u3011<br>\u2013 Discord: https://discord.gg/tSVJcaT6jU<br>\u2013 FB Page: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61553417999413<br>\u2013 Email: yoyocreations@outlook.com<br>\u2013 TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@iamyoyodoll<br>\u2013 Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSAAS6shg37jL